## Critical Bugs (Don't Reintroduce)

| Bug | Fix | Why |
|-----|-----|-----|
| Bigram separators | SPACE not underscore | Breaks query expansion |
| Edge rebuild | `from_id`/`to_id` not `source_id`/`target_id` | Breaks relationships |
| O(n²) bigrams | `max_bigrams_per_term=100` | 20s→10s |
| O(n²) semantics | `max_similarity_pairs=100000` | 30s→5s |

